 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Do you like stories?",
   "zh": "你喜欢听故事吗？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 7.4,
    "end": 10
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "I want to tell you a true story.",
   "zh": "我要告诉你一个真实的故事。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 10,
    "end": 13.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "It happened to a friend of mine a year ago.",
   "zh": "这是一年前发生在我的一个朋友身上的故事。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 13.4,
    "end": 17.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "While my friend, George, was reading in bed,",
   "zh": "当我的朋友乔治在床上看书时，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 17.3,
    "end": 20.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "two thieves climbed into his kitchen.",
   "zh": "两个小偷爬进了他的厨房。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 20.4,
    "end": 24.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "After they had entered the house,",
   "zh": "他们进到屋里后，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 24.6,
    "end": 27
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "they went into the dining room.",
   "zh": "走进了饭厅。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 27,
    "end": 30.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "It was very dark,",
   "zh": "饭厅里很暗，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 30.2,
    "end": 32.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "so they turned on a torch.",
   "zh": "于是他们打开了手电筒。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 32.1,
    "end": 35.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Suddenly, they heard a voice behind them.",
   "zh": "突然他们听到身后有声音。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 35.4,
    "end": 39.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'What's up? What's up?' someone called.",
   "zh": "“什么事？什么事？”有人叫着。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 39.2,
    "end": 42.9
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "The thieves dropped the torch and ran away as quickly as they could.",
   "zh": "小偷扔下了手电筒，飞快地逃走了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 42.9,
    "end": 48.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "George heard the noise and came downstairs quickly.",
   "zh": "乔治听到了响声，迅速地下了楼。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 48.1,
    "end": 52.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He turned on the light,",
   "zh": "他开了灯，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 52.1,
    "end": 54.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "but he couldn't see anyone.",
   "zh": "但不见一个人。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 54.5,
    "end": 57.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "The thieves had already gone.",
   "zh": "小偷逃走了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 57.2,
    "end": 60.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "But George's parrot, Henry, was still there.",
   "zh": "但是乔治的鹦鹉亨利仍在那里。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 60.3,
    "end": 64.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'What's up, George?' he called.",
   "zh": "“什么事，乔治？”它叫着。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 64.6,
    "end": 67.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'Nothing, Henry,' George said and smiled.",
   "zh": "“没事，亨利。”乔治笑着说，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 67.5,
    "end": 70.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "'Go back to sleep.'",
   "zh": "“接着睡觉吧。”",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L119.mp4",
    "start": 70.4,
    "end": 72.5
   }
  }
 ],
